    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">以一個附贈動作，你可以對距你30尺內的一名可見自願生物揮舞這張卡片，賦予該生物對未來的瞬間洞察。直到你的下一個回合開始，該生物在攻擊檢定、屬性檢定和豁免檢定上具有優勢。此外，其他生物在持續時間內對該目標的攻擊檢定具有劣勢。這一特性一經使用，直到次日黎明之前無法再次使用。</span></p><p>As a bonus action, you can brandish this card at one willing creature you can see within 30 feet of yourself, granting the creature a brief glimpse of the future. Until the start of your next turn, the creature has advantage on attack rolls, ability checks, and saving throws. Additionally, other creatures have disadvantage on attack rolls against the target for the duration. Once this property is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p></div>",
